From 8d8fd23f8549ddb4d278a392058e7125cf3c9243 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: "yicong.wu" <yicong.wu@sophgo.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 10:37:08 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] feat: update GC4683 vendor driver for image-quality
 evaluation

Import the complete driver files from the 20260729 GC4683 vendor package.
Update initialization registers for 1440p60, 1080p60 and 720p120, including
0x0248, 0x146e, 0x0243, 0x029d and the post-delay 0x0a70 write. Update the
0x04d1..0x04df settings in 1440p60 and 1080p60.

Use the vendor column-gain register table, gain thresholds and maximum
analog gain of 151168. Preserve vendor contents without adjusting the
package's existing gain-limit inconsistencies. The two sensor headers
are unchanged.

AliOS consumes this repository through its SensorSupportList symlink.
Validation: clean_alios && build_alios for cv1842cp_dc100_spinand passed.
Board image-quality validation is pending.

Change-Id: I79292ab818fc109c5d67a90c5b6853ab4ef3e699
